flowchart TB
  accTitle: Teach Anything architecture
  accDescr: A Next.js app. Pages reach stored state only through the session service, which hands the learning history to a pure, seeded learning engine built on FSRS-6 memory and Bayesian mastery estimates, and gets back the next activity and due dates. State lives in Postgres with pgvector, row-level security, and an append-only mastery log; a database trigger refuses to serve a question without a grounded source. Code exercises run in QuickJS or a network-less Docker sandbox. Every model call goes through one AI gateway to the provider the learner configures, and a course worker builds courses behind human review gates.

  subgraph app["NEXT.JS APP"]
    ui["`**Pages**
    server actions`"]
    svc["`**Session service**
    only door to state`"]
    engine["`**Learning engine**
    FSRS-6 + mastery, pure`"]
    ai["`**AI gateway**
    schemas, budgets, cache`"]
    worker["`**Course worker**
    review-gated builds`"]
  end

  db[("`**Postgres + pgvector**
  RLS, mastery event log`")]
  sandbox["`**Sandboxes**
  QuickJS, Docker Python`"]
  model["`**Model provider**
  learner's own key`"]

  ui ==> svc
  svc <==>|history in, plan out| engine
  svc <-->|grounded items only| db
  svc --> sandbox
  svc --> ai
  worker --> ai
  worker --> db
  ai --> model

